I would change the engine from our previous conception to this:

```text
TIER 0 — FEASIBILITY
name.com inventory
purchase budget
renewal budget
premium policy
TLD policy


TIER 1 — NAME PROPERTIES
pronounceability
length
spelling
obvious ambiguity


TIER 2 — SEMANTIC PROXY
Semantic Inversion:
"What would X.dev do?"


TIER 3 — CHOICE
Pairwise selection in controlled context


TIER 4 — AGENT DISCOVERY
Given a realistic task + candidate services,
which one does the agent select?


TIER 5 — EXECUTION
Agent invokes the selected service


TIER 6 — VERIFIED OUTCOME
Did hidden deterministic verifier confirm
the requested job was completed?


TIER 7 — ROBUSTNESS
Repeat across model families / time windows


TIER 8 — FIELD OUTCOME
Actual impressions → selections →
registrations → eventual real usage
```

**Tier 6 is the scientific moat.**

Most competitors stop somewhere between Tier 1 and Tier 3.

